@@ -45,3 +45,12 @@ Validation: `node --check public/app.js`, `node --check src/app.js`, and `node -
 ## Football.com Nigeria read-only data adapter (2026-10-29)
 
 `src/integrations/footballcom-data.js` parses the Football.com shared booking-code list (share code, folds, total odds, events with selected odds) using the same event shape as the SportyBet adapter, and `GET /api/footballcom/booking-codes` exposes it to members with a Football.com Nigeria subscription. The upstream URL is configuration (`FOOTBALLCOM_API_BASE_URL`, `FOOTBALLCOM_BOOKING_CODES_PATH`) because no official documented endpoint is verified; the route returns 503 `FOOTBALLCOM_NOT_CONFIGURED` until both are set. Each code holds only the selections its author booked, not full market lists. This is read-only data: bet placement, account login and balance lookup for Football.com remain unavailable and behind the connector release gate.
+
+
+## Guarded Hector execution adapter (opt-in)
+
+BETGO now has an opt-in adapter for the unofficial Hector CLI. It is disabled unless `WAGER_EXECUTION_ENABLED=true` and the `hector` binary is installed. Browser session cookies imported per SportyBet account are encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a key derived from `SESSION_SECRET`; they are never returned by account APIs or written to audit logs. Rotating `SESSION_SECRET` makes stored cookies undecryptable, so remove/re-import them after a rotation.
+
+The confirmation route only handles **one selection per wager** because Hector's documented CLI is a single-selection executor. Accumulators are rejected. A confirmed instruction is attempted once per account with an imported session; each attempt has a deterministic unique ID and is persisted before execution. No automatic retry occurs. An unparseable result, timeout, process failure, or uncertain provider response is classified `unknown` and must be reconciled against SportyBet Bet History and Hector's append-only journal before any manual action.
+
+The route rechecks current event/outcome/odds before the first submission, requires an exact typed confirmation and a maximum total stake across all accounts, and respects BETGO's global emergency stop. It does not verify imported sessions ahead of submission; a stored session is not proof that it is still valid. Hector's result JSON format and live wager acceptance have not been verified against a live SportyBet account in this development environment. Treat the adapter as **unverified until staged with a low-risk test**, and keep the feature flag off until then. Use a persistent `HECTOR_JOURNAL_DIR` in deployment; an ephemeral filesystem weakens post-crash reconciliation.
